   "sourceHash": "5b60cb3efc31160c23a268dfc9ed059b100b138b57ec0b7cf39038ce41665392",
   "text": "融入这些原则后，瑜伽便成为实现自我转变与整体健康的有力方式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
